        <inbodydescription>
<para>At this point:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>We&apos;ve broken a &quot;main loop&quot; out of the loop in a way that the &quot;main loop&quot; runs with the induction variable in a subset of [Begin, End).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>There is no overflow when computing &quot;main loop&quot; exit limit.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Max latch taken count of the loop is limited. It guarantees that induction variable will not overflow iterating in the &quot;main loop&quot;.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
